1
00:00:24,077 --> 00:00:25,145
<font color="#FFFFFF">There you go.</font>

2
00:00:46,454 --> 00:00:48,682
<font color="#FFFFFF">Where'd this one come from
so early in the morning?</font>

3
00:00:49,481 --> 00:00:53,477
<font color="#FFFFFF">Th-This is Takamaru, the fastest
messenger in all the Hidden Sand!</font>

4
00:00:56,774 --> 00:00:58,072
<font color="#FFFFFF">Break!</font>

5
00:01:02,208 --> 00:01:03,107
<font color="#FFFFFF">What's this...?</font>

6
00:01:04,636 --> 00:01:06,504
<font color="#FFFFFF">It's a level-one emergency message!</font>

7
00:01:08,832 --> 00:01:10,400
<font color="#FFFFFF">Contact the Cipher Corps
immediately!</font>

8
00:01:11,459 --> 00:01:13,997
<font color="#FFFFFF">It's sure been a long time
since I've been on a mission...</font>

9
00:01:14,027 --> 00:01:15,555
<font color="#FFFFFF">I'm so excited!</font>

10
00:01:15,825 --> 00:01:18,452
<font color="#FFFFFF">Naruto, accept the mission
without complaint,</font>

11
00:01:18,492 --> 00:01:20,450
<font color="#FFFFFF">no matter what we're ordered to do.</font>

12
00:01:20,590 --> 00:01:22,518
<font color="#FFFFFF">I know!</font>

13
00:01:22,648 --> 00:01:24,186
<font color="#FFFFFF">I hope so...</font>

14
00:01:25,785 --> 00:01:27,043
<font color="#FFFFFF">Move it, move it!</font>

15
00:01:28,013 --> 00:01:29,012
<font color="#FFFFFF">What was that?</font>

16
00:01:29,041 --> 00:01:31,839
<font color="#FFFFFF">Watch it, you! Be more careful!</font>

17
00:01:32,538 --> 00:01:34,206
<font color="#FFFFFF">So the Cipher Corps
was summoned, huh...?</font>

18
00:01:34,706 --> 00:01:37,603
<font color="#FFFFFF">Then what the bird from earlier
brought must've been...</font>

19
00:01:38,172 --> 00:01:40,630
<font color="#FFFFFF">You said there's
a level-one emergency message?</font>

20
00:01:41,069 --> 00:01:42,228
<font color="#FFFFFF">Are you sure?</font>

21
00:01:42,528 --> 00:01:43,927
<font color="#FFFFFF">Yes. It's right here...</font>

22
00:01:47,023 --> 00:01:48,192
<font color="#FFFFFF">It's from the Sand, huh...?</font>

23
00:01:50,020 --> 00:01:50,920
<font color="#FFFFFF">Break!</font>

24
00:01:55,415 --> 00:01:57,413
<font color="#FFFFFF">That message coming here means...</font>

25
00:01:57,653 --> 00:01:59,411
<font color="#FFFFFF">No doubt something's happened
in the Sand!</font>

26
00:01:59,611 --> 00:02:00,410
<font color="#FFFFFF">Okay!</font>

27
00:02:00,850 --> 00:02:02,278
<font color="#FFFFFF">I'll get right to deciphering it!</font>

28
00:03:34,856 --> 00:03:36,913
<font color="#FFFFFF">Team Kakashi, Deployed</font>

29
00:03:36,953 --> 00:03:39,851
<font color="#FFFFFF">Who'd have thought you could keep up
with Crow's speed...</font>

30
00:03:40,580 --> 00:03:42,977
<font color="#FFFFFF">It looked like the fly was
about to land, you see.</font>

31
00:03:44,706 --> 00:03:45,875
<font color="#FFFFFF">I remember now.</font>

32
00:03:47,873 --> 00:03:51,099
<font color="#FFFFFF">This Jinchuriki guy had some siblings.</font>

33
00:03:51,869 --> 00:03:55,065
<font color="#FFFFFF">And I heard that one of them
uses Puppets...</font>

34
00:03:55,235 --> 00:03:57,193
<font color="#FFFFFF">This is probably that guy...</font>

35
00:03:58,891 --> 00:04:02,858
<font color="#FFFFFF">I think his name was Kantaro...
I mean, Kanpachi, or something...?</font>

36
00:04:03,227 --> 00:04:04,386
<font color="#FFFFFF">It's Kankuro!</font>

37
00:04:17,073 --> 00:04:20,939
<font color="#FFFFFF">I'm telling you I'm your opponent.</font>

38
00:04:22,108 --> 00:04:25,235
<font color="#FFFFFF">And you quit gawking
and get out of here.</font>

39
00:04:25,335 --> 00:04:26,334
<font color="#FFFFFF">You're in the way.</font>

40
00:04:26,734 --> 00:04:29,701
<font color="#FFFFFF">You're right... I'll be going, then.</font>

41
00:04:31,898 --> 00:04:32,897
<font color="#FFFFFF">Hey, hold it!</font>

42
00:04:36,024 --> 00:04:37,952
<font color="#FFFFFF">Don't make me repeat myself...</font>

43
00:04:38,352 --> 00:04:40,490
<font color="#FFFFFF">I'm your opponent...</font>

44
00:04:42,318 --> 00:04:44,146
<font color="#FFFFFF">It looks like I'll have to take care
of this guy</font>

45
00:04:44,186 --> 00:04:45,685
<font color="#FFFFFF">and then go after the other one...</font>

46
00:04:49,910 --> 00:04:51,409
<font color="#FFFFFF">You're sure unlucky...</font>

47
00:04:52,078 --> 00:04:56,234
<font color="#FFFFFF">My man Sasori just might be
the worst possible opponent for you.</font>

48
00:05:04,326 --> 00:05:06,424
<font color="#FFFFFF">There might still be
some traps remaining...</font>

49
00:05:06,923 --> 00:05:07,962
<font color="#FFFFFF">Be careful...</font>

50
00:05:11,119 --> 00:05:13,617
<font color="#FFFFFF">Preparations for mobilization of
the tracking unit have been completed.</font>

51
00:05:14,056 --> 00:05:16,414
<font color="#FFFFFF">All right, go after Kankuro immediately.</font>

52
00:05:16,784 --> 00:05:20,050
<font color="#FFFFFF">Even if you find the enemy,
avoid battle as best you can.</font>

53
00:05:20,410 --> 00:05:23,507
<font color="#FFFFFF">Our only goal is to find
the enemy hideout.</font>

54
00:05:23,547 --> 00:05:24,276
<font color="#FFFFFF">- Yes, sir!
- Yes, sir!</font>

55
00:05:24,446 --> 00:05:28,372
<font color="#FFFFFF">We'll send out the Kazekage rescue team
as soon as we find their hideout.</font>

56
00:05:28,742 --> 00:05:30,570
<font color="#FFFFFF">You'd better come back
with some information!</font>

57
00:05:31,669 --> 00:05:32,468
<font color="#FFFFFF">Get going!</font>

58
00:05:32,598 --> 00:05:33,467
<font color="#FFFFFF">- Yes, sir!
- Yes, sir!</font>

59
00:05:36,963 --> 00:05:40,160
<font color="#FFFFFF">Kankuro... Make sure you don't do
anything reckless...</font>

60
00:05:41,229 --> 00:05:44,955
<font color="#FFFFFF">I'll show you my Puppet Show!</font>

61
00:05:49,820 --> 00:05:51,019
<font color="#FFFFFF">There! There!</font>

62
00:06:01,209 --> 00:06:03,207
<font color="#FFFFFF">You're pretty good...
However...</font>

63
00:06:06,204 --> 00:06:09,131
<font color="#FFFFFF">You didn't notice that
the Black Ant was gone, did you?</font>

64
00:06:17,892 --> 00:06:18,891
<font color="#FFFFFF">Here goes!</font>

65
00:06:21,519 --> 00:06:22,917
<font color="#FFFFFF">Puppet Show!</font>

66
00:06:31,808 --> 00:06:34,006
<font color="#FFFFFF">Puppet Show
Secret Black Move Iron Maiden!</font>

67
00:06:46,923 --> 00:06:48,192
<font color="#FFFFFF">The show's over.</font>

68
00:06:48,961 --> 00:06:50,220
<font color="#FFFFFF">Whaaat?</font>

69
00:06:50,719 --> 00:06:52,987
<font color="#FFFFFF">A guard for gold bullion
transport convoy?</font>

70
00:06:53,017 --> 00:06:55,784
<font color="#FFFFFF">Huh? You got a problem?</font>

71
00:06:55,854 --> 00:06:57,882
<font color="#FFFFFF">That's totally a C-rank mission!</font>

72
00:06:58,052 --> 00:07:00,650
<font color="#FFFFFF">I'll just have to say no thanks
to a mission like that...</font>

73
00:07:00,680 --> 00:07:03,277
<font color="#FFFFFF">And here I just told him
not to complain.</font>

74
00:07:03,477 --> 00:07:06,074
<font color="#FFFFFF">Please don't act so selfish...</font>

75
00:07:06,404 --> 00:07:08,202
<font color="#FFFFFF">I'm the one she's going to get mad at...</font>

76
00:07:08,642 --> 00:07:12,138
<font color="#FFFFFF">I knew he'd react like this...
Good grief...</font>

77
00:07:12,797 --> 00:07:15,465
<font color="#FFFFFF">Ohh, just as you thought...</font>

78
00:07:18,062 --> 00:07:22,687
<font color="#FFFFFF">Naruto, you haven't matured
mentally at all, have you...?</font>

79
00:07:23,057 --> 00:07:23,986
<font color="#FFFFFF">Naruto...</font>

80
00:07:24,286 --> 00:07:28,981
<font color="#FFFFFF">I gave you an easier mission since
this is more or less a comeback for you...</font>

81
00:07:29,081 --> 00:07:31,419
<font color="#FFFFFF">I didn't ask for this!</font>

82
00:07:31,649 --> 00:07:35,914
<font color="#FFFFFF">I-I'm sorry, Master! I'll give him
a good scolding later...</font>

83
00:07:36,544 --> 00:07:39,041
<font color="#FFFFFF">Y-You moron!
You can talk like that</font>

84
00:07:39,071 --> 00:07:42,108
<font color="#FFFFFF">because you don't know
how frightening she can be... Cha!</font>

85
00:07:43,037 --> 00:07:45,165
<font color="#FFFFFF">The details of the mission
are written here.</font>

86
00:07:45,405 --> 00:07:46,164
<font color="#FFFFFF">Right!</font>

87
00:07:46,763 --> 00:07:47,702
<font color="#FFFFFF">Geez, man...</font>

88
00:07:47,732 --> 00:07:51,958
<font color="#FFFFFF">The old man Third Hokage
was much more understanding ...</font>

89
00:07:52,198 --> 00:07:54,056
<font color="#FFFFFF">Huh? Did you say something?</font>

90
00:07:54,126 --> 00:07:57,123
<font color="#FFFFFF">Hey! Knock it off!</font>

91
00:07:58,192 --> 00:07:59,990
<font color="#FFFFFF">Th-There's trouble... Fifth Hokage!</font>

92
00:08:00,050 --> 00:08:01,449
<font color="#FFFFFF">What's all the commotion...?</font>

93
00:08:01,688 --> 00:08:04,086
<font color="#FFFFFF">We just received an emergency message
from the Sand...</font>

94
00:08:04,645 --> 00:08:05,515
<font color="#FFFFFF">The Sand...?</font>

95
00:08:05,545 --> 00:08:06,883
<font color="#FFFFFF">Did you say an emergency message?</font>

96
00:08:07,483 --> 00:08:08,811
<font color="#FFFFFF">This is what we have deciphered...</font>

97
00:08:11,738 --> 00:08:12,637
<font color="#FFFFFF">What?</font>

98
00:08:25,225 --> 00:08:26,064
<font color="#FFFFFF">Sand?</font>

99
00:08:42,308 --> 00:08:43,377
<font color="#FFFFFF">A sand clone...?</font>

100
00:08:55,065 --> 00:08:56,863
<font color="#FFFFFF">Oh... my god...</font>

101
00:08:57,463 --> 00:08:58,532
<font color="#FFFFFF">It can't be...</font>

102
00:09:01,988 --> 00:09:04,556
<font color="#FFFFFF">Hey... What happened...?</font>

103
00:09:07,253 --> 00:09:09,321
<font color="#FFFFFF">The Kazekage of the Hidden Sand
has been taken</font>

104
00:09:09,351 --> 00:09:11,878
<font color="#FFFFFF">by members of the organization
called the Akatsuki.</font>

105
00:09:14,615 --> 00:09:15,644
<font color="#FFFFFF">Gaara...</font>

106
00:09:16,643 --> 00:09:18,542
<font color="#FFFFFF">Those guys again, huh...?</font>

107
00:09:22,667 --> 00:09:26,663
<font color="#FFFFFF">We have more information
concerning the Akatsuki.</font>

108
00:09:27,632 --> 00:09:31,129
<font color="#FFFFFF">And so the Hidden Sand has
officially requested our help...</font>

109
00:09:33,227 --> 00:09:35,694
<font color="#FFFFFF">Lady Tsunade, don't tell me
you're going to have Team Kakashi...?</font>

110
00:09:35,854 --> 00:09:37,023
<font color="#FFFFFF">This is a time of emergency.</font>

111
00:09:37,053 --> 00:09:39,091
<font color="#FFFFFF">I can't be wasting time
on personnel selection.</font>

112
00:09:39,920 --> 00:09:41,948
<font color="#FFFFFF">And besides, we've got someone here</font>

113
00:09:41,988 --> 00:09:43,487
<font color="#FFFFFF">who's actually fought against
the Akatsuki...</font>

114
00:09:44,186 --> 00:09:46,114
<font color="#FFFFFF">I understand that, but...</font>

115
00:09:46,214 --> 00:09:49,241
<font color="#FFFFFF">I will now issue Team Kakashi
a new mission.</font>

116
00:09:49,810 --> 00:09:51,838
<font color="#FFFFFF">Go to the Village Hidden
in the Sand immediately,</font>

117
00:09:51,878 --> 00:09:54,476
<font color="#FFFFFF">find out what's going on and
report back to the Leaf...</font>

118
00:09:54,805 --> 00:09:56,773
<font color="#FFFFFF">After that, you will follow the orders
of the Hidden Sand</font>

119
00:09:56,803 --> 00:09:58,232
<font color="#FFFFFF">and provide them with back-up!</font>

120
00:10:06,923 --> 00:10:08,062
<font color="#FFFFFF">How...?</font>

121
00:10:11,459 --> 00:10:12,817
<font color="#FFFFFF">How...?</font>

122
00:10:19,880 --> 00:10:22,547
<font color="#FFFFFF">How can he read
my movements like this...?</font>

123
00:10:23,177 --> 00:10:25,674
<font color="#FFFFFF">And on top of that,
he's hardly moved at all the whole time...</font>

124
00:10:26,603 --> 00:10:29,700
<font color="#FFFFFF">What's the matter?
Are you already finished...?</font>

125
00:10:31,638 --> 00:10:33,067
<font color="#FFFFFF">Like hell I am!</font>

126
00:10:42,727 --> 00:10:44,186
<font color="#FFFFFF">Poisoned Mist Inferno...</font>

127
00:10:44,286 --> 00:10:46,054
<font color="#FFFFFF">Consecutive Needle Combo!</font>

128
00:11:03,207 --> 00:11:04,406
<font color="#FFFFFF">Are you finished?</font>

129
00:11:04,535 --> 00:11:08,132
<font color="#FFFFFF">No way... How is he not affected by
being in the Poisoned Mist?</font>

130
00:11:08,961 --> 00:11:14,096
<font color="#FFFFFF">Making people wait any longer than this
goes against my policy...</font>

131
00:11:14,725 --> 00:11:17,822
<font color="#FFFFFF">I think it's just about my turn now!</font>

132
00:11:22,418 --> 00:11:24,815
<font color="#FFFFFF">Salamander has an iron wall defense...</font>

133
00:11:38,631 --> 00:11:42,028
<font color="#FFFFFF">It can withstand a direct hit from
a few thousand tons of rocks...</font>

134
00:11:46,264 --> 00:11:49,391
<font color="#FFFFFF">You won't be able to inflict even
a scratch on me.</font>

135
00:11:50,090 --> 00:11:53,217
<font color="#FFFFFF">It's safe to say the defensive strength
of that puppet</font>

136
00:11:53,257 --> 00:11:55,784
<font color="#FFFFFF">is indeed of the highest level.</font>

137
00:11:56,384 --> 00:11:57,582
<font color="#FFFFFF">However...</font>

138
00:11:57,612 --> 00:12:00,280
<font color="#FFFFFF">There's always a weakness.</font>

139
00:12:01,508 --> 00:12:02,547
<font color="#FFFFFF">It's futile!</font>

140
00:12:09,241 --> 00:12:10,599
<font color="#FFFFFF">N-No way...</font>

141
00:12:12,467 --> 00:12:15,195
<font color="#FFFFFF">He figured out Salamander's weakness
in one glance...?</font>

142
00:12:21,888 --> 00:12:25,155
<font color="#FFFFFF">No matter how strong the puppet may be,</font>

143
00:12:25,185 --> 00:12:30,350
<font color="#FFFFFF">the movable parts of the joints
are weaker than the other parts.</font>

144
00:12:38,511 --> 00:12:41,838
<font color="#FFFFFF">Now then, shall we go for the finale?</font>

145
00:12:52,957 --> 00:12:55,325
<font color="#FFFFFF">I usually don't believe
in stuff like this, but...</font>

146
00:12:58,451 --> 00:13:01,718
<font color="#FFFFFF">I've kind of got
a bad feeling about this...</font>

147
00:13:18,501 --> 00:13:19,570
<font color="#FFFFFF">How...?</font>

148
00:13:19,800 --> 00:13:22,927
<font color="#FFFFFF">How can he read
my hidden weapon attack schemes...?</font>

149
00:13:23,696 --> 00:13:25,394
<font color="#FFFFFF">You've got solid talent...</font>

150
00:13:25,424 --> 00:13:28,062
<font color="#FFFFFF">However, you picked
the wrong opponent.</font>

151
00:13:30,719 --> 00:13:34,785
<font color="#FFFFFF">Your puppets
with the hidden poison weapons...</font>

152
00:13:38,152 --> 00:13:40,309
<font color="#FFFFFF">I can see through them all...</font>

153
00:13:45,604 --> 00:13:47,942
<font color="#FFFFFF">Crow! Black Ant! Salamander!</font>

154
00:13:50,339 --> 00:13:51,668
<font color="#FFFFFF">This is the first time</font>

155
00:13:51,698 --> 00:13:53,596
<font color="#FFFFFF">my hidden weapon attacks
have been read like this...</font>

156
00:13:55,534 --> 00:13:57,462
<font color="#FFFFFF">You look puzzled...</font>

157
00:13:57,492 --> 00:13:59,660
<font color="#FFFFFF">You're wondering how
I figured out your attacks, huh?</font>

158
00:13:59,860 --> 00:14:01,358
<font color="#FFFFFF">Of course I did.</font>

159
00:14:01,388 --> 00:14:02,557
<font color="#FFFFFF">Crow...</font>

160
00:14:02,957 --> 00:14:04,156
<font color="#FFFFFF">Black Ant...</font>

161
00:14:04,285 --> 00:14:05,554
<font color="#FFFFFF">Salamander...</font>

162
00:14:06,154 --> 00:14:11,878
<font color="#FFFFFF">The one who created these
three puppets is none other... than me!</font>

163
00:14:56,473 --> 00:14:58,102
<font color="#FFFFFF">That scroll...?</font>

164
00:14:58,631 --> 00:15:01,368
<font color="#FFFFFF">You idiot! Hurry up and show it to me!</font>

165
00:15:04,825 --> 00:15:05,964
<font color="#FFFFFF">What...?</font>

166
00:15:07,123 --> 00:15:09,690
<font color="#FFFFFF">The Kazekage of the Hidden Sand
has been...</font>

167
00:15:11,119 --> 00:15:13,956
<font color="#FFFFFF">Looks like this isn't the time
to be sleeping like this!</font>

168
00:15:19,980 --> 00:15:24,146
<font color="#FFFFFF">I ended up making
someone wait a bit...</font>

169
00:15:24,475 --> 00:15:26,773
<font color="#FFFFFF">But I never thought my opponent
would be</font>

170
00:15:26,803 --> 00:15:28,771
<font color="#FFFFFF">one of my adorable juniors
using hand-me-downs.</font>

171
00:15:28,801 --> 00:15:31,438
<font color="#FFFFFF">I haven't had such a fun fight
in quite some time.</font>

172
00:15:32,297 --> 00:15:38,231
<font color="#FFFFFF">Then, you're... the celebrated master
craftsman of the puppet unit,</font>

173
00:15:38,991 --> 00:15:41,228
<font color="#FFFFFF">Sasori of the Red Sand?</font>

174
00:15:44,655 --> 00:15:49,920
<font color="#FFFFFF">I'm honored that a kid like you
knows my name.</font>

175
00:15:49,950 --> 00:15:52,317
<font color="#FFFFFF">You left the Sand over twenty years ago.</font>

176
00:15:52,347 --> 00:15:53,516
<font color="#FFFFFF">What're you doing here?</font>

177
00:15:55,344 --> 00:15:59,370
<font color="#FFFFFF">What's the point of asking such
a thing before you die?</font>

178
00:16:12,257 --> 00:16:17,222
<font color="#FFFFFF">My body's getting numb...
Don't tell me he also uses poison...</font>

179
00:16:17,252 --> 00:16:18,551
<font color="#FFFFFF">But when?</font>

180
00:16:19,990 --> 00:16:22,587
<font color="#FFFFFF">I know! At that moment!</font>

181
00:16:24,715 --> 00:16:28,541
<font color="#FFFFFF">The poison's circulating, huh...?
You're finished!</font>

182
00:16:47,392 --> 00:16:53,186
<font color="#FFFFFF">You're just going to suffer.
But if you want to live that badly...</font>

183
00:16:53,616 --> 00:16:55,884
<font color="#FFFFFF">I won't finish you off!</font>

184
00:16:56,513 --> 00:17:01,248
<font color="#FFFFFF">However, that poison will kill you
in less than three days.</font>

185
00:17:07,372 --> 00:17:08,441
<font color="#FFFFFF">Gaara...</font>

186
00:17:17,192 --> 00:17:18,731
<font color="#FFFFFF">Damn it...!</font>

187
00:17:20,729 --> 00:17:22,557
<font color="#FFFFFF">There he is! He's over there!</font>

188
00:17:22,587 --> 00:17:25,224
<font color="#FFFFFF">He's collapsed!
And his puppets are smashed...</font>

189
00:17:26,883 --> 00:17:28,781
<font color="#FFFFFF">Okay, we're off now!</font>

190
00:17:32,117 --> 00:17:35,074
<font color="#FFFFFF">We'll be back, Master.</font>

191
00:17:35,674 --> 00:17:36,643
<font color="#FFFFFF">Right...</font>

192
00:17:43,136 --> 00:17:44,905
<font color="#FFFFFF">Naruto, good luck!</font>

193
00:17:45,464 --> 00:17:46,403
<font color="#FFFFFF">Thanks.</font>

194
00:17:50,499 --> 00:17:51,298
<font color="#FFFFFF">Hey!</font>

195
00:17:51,758 --> 00:17:53,426
<font color="#FFFFFF">Are you off on a mission now, Naruto?</font>

196
00:17:53,556 --> 00:17:54,495
<font color="#FFFFFF">That's right!</font>

197
00:17:54,855 --> 00:17:56,423
<font color="#FFFFFF">Oh, more importantly.</font>

198
00:18:00,889 --> 00:18:02,587
<font color="#FFFFFF">Tsunade, I've got some information
for you.</font>

199
00:18:02,917 --> 00:18:05,184
<font color="#FFFFFF">- The Kazekage of the Hidden Sand...
- I know.</font>

200
00:18:05,744 --> 00:18:08,111
<font color="#FFFFFF">I'm just about to send them off
to the Sand now.</font>

201
00:18:09,980 --> 00:18:11,278
<font color="#FFFFFF">Right, right.</font>

202
00:18:14,135 --> 00:18:17,172
<font color="#FFFFFF">You know about the Akatsuki
and Naruto, don't you...?</font>

203
00:18:17,632 --> 00:18:18,731
<font color="#FFFFFF">It's an emergency situation you see...</font>

204
00:18:19,430 --> 00:18:21,028
<font color="#FFFFFF">I just made the best choice I could.</font>

205
00:18:21,668 --> 00:18:23,266
<font color="#FFFFFF">Oh, come on...</font>

206
00:18:25,164 --> 00:18:27,292
<font color="#FFFFFF">Naruto, come here for a second.</font>

207
00:18:27,462 --> 00:18:28,161
<font color="#FFFFFF">Hm?</font>

208
00:18:31,558 --> 00:18:35,914
<font color="#FFFFFF">Listen up, Naruto.
Don't get reckless against the Akatsuki.</font>

209
00:18:36,053 --> 00:18:38,051
<font color="#FFFFFF">They've got business with me.</font>

210
00:18:38,281 --> 00:18:40,779
<font color="#FFFFFF">So this time I'll go to them!</font>

211
00:18:42,577 --> 00:18:45,074
<font color="#FFFFFF">You have indeed gotten stronger...</font>

212
00:18:45,644 --> 00:18:49,040
<font color="#FFFFFF">But if you don't keep cool,
you'll just be asking for trouble.</font>

213
00:18:49,700 --> 00:18:52,797
<font color="#FFFFFF">Losing your cool right away
is a bad habit of yours.</font>

214
00:18:58,231 --> 00:19:01,788
<font color="#FFFFFF">Naruto... I think you know...</font>

215
00:19:02,187 --> 00:19:04,055
<font color="#FFFFFF">But don't use that power.</font>

216
00:19:09,020 --> 00:19:10,519
<font color="#FFFFFF">I know...</font>

217
00:19:15,574 --> 00:19:16,943
<font color="#FFFFFF">Kakashi...</font>

218
00:19:16,972 --> 00:19:20,039
<font color="#FFFFFF">Keep an eye on Naruto and make sure
he doesn't do anything too reckless.</font>

219
00:19:20,069 --> 00:19:21,938
<font color="#FFFFFF">I'm counting on you. Okay?</font>

220
00:19:23,466 --> 00:19:24,435
<font color="#FFFFFF">Okay.</font>

221
00:19:25,764 --> 00:19:29,030
<font color="#FFFFFF">Kakashi Sensei, Sakura,
let's get a move on!</font>

222
00:19:29,200 --> 00:19:30,958
<font color="#FFFFFF">H-Hey, wait up!</font>

223
00:19:32,457 --> 00:19:33,456
<font color="#FFFFFF">We're off.</font>

224
00:19:36,053 --> 00:19:37,522
<font color="#FFFFFF">Oh boy...</font>

225
00:19:42,187 --> 00:19:43,286
<font color="#FFFFFF">Are you worried?</font>

226
00:19:43,616 --> 00:19:44,615
<font color="#FFFFFF">No, I'm not...</font>

227
00:19:44,645 --> 00:19:49,680
<font color="#FFFFFF">He's no longer a weak Shinobi
I need to worry about...</font>

228
00:19:50,379 --> 00:19:51,708
<font color="#FFFFFF">And the same goes for Sakura.</font>

229
00:19:52,777 --> 00:19:55,674
<font color="#FFFFFF">Growth is sure a mysterious thing.</font>

230
00:20:00,499 --> 00:20:02,397
<font color="#FFFFFF">Hang on, Gaara!</font>

231
00:21:37,402 --> 00:21:39,700
<font color="#FFFFFF">What's the matter, Kankuro?</font>

232
00:21:39,899 --> 00:21:42,467
<font color="#FFFFFF">Actually, my makeup remover
doesn't really agree with my skin.</font>

233
00:21:42,567 --> 00:21:44,994
<font color="#FFFFFF">At a time like that, you need
this makeup remover gauze.</font>

234
00:21:45,024 --> 00:21:48,121
<font color="#FFFFFF">It's gentle on the skin as
the microfibers help remove the dirt</font>

235
00:21:48,161 --> 00:21:49,859
<font color="#FFFFFF">from inside your pores.</font>

236
00:21:49,959 --> 00:21:52,117
<font color="#FFFFFF">Ooh, the Kumadori is coming right off.</font>

237
00:21:52,157 --> 00:21:53,756
<font color="#FFFFFF">And not only that, if you buy now,</font>

238
00:21:53,786 --> 00:21:57,981
<font color="#FFFFFF">you'll get one more for free along
with a handy storage case.</font>

239
00:21:58,011 --> 00:22:02,107
<font color="#FFFFFF">Whoa, this is serious.
I'd better hurry right to the Sand shop.</font>

240
00:22:03,006 --> 00:22:05,344
<font color="#FFFFFF">Next time:
"The Jinchuriki's Tears"</font>

